@startuml
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
actor User
participant "UI Layer\n(HistoryView)" as UI
participant "Logic Layer\n(HistoryService)" as Logic
database "Database\n(FilesRepository)" as DB

User -> UI : 1. Navigate to History
activate UI
UI -> Logic : 2. getActiveUserHistory(Username)
activate Logic
Logic -> DB : 3. Fetch files where isDeleted=false
activate DB
DB --> Logic : 4. Return active files
deactivate DB
Logic --> UI : 5. Return List of Files
deactivate Logic
UI --> User : 6. Display Files in Grid
        
User -> UI : 7. Click "Delete"
UI --> User : 8. Show Confirmation Dialog
User -> UI : 9. Confirm Delete
UI -> Logic : 10. softDeleteFile(FileID) (Background Thread)
activate Logic
Logic -> DB : 11. Update DB: set isDeleted = true
activate DB
DB --> Logic : 12. Confirm Update
deactivate DB
Logic --> UI : 13. Return Success
deactivate Logic
UI --> User : 14. Update UI: Remove Row & Show Notification
deactivate UI
@enduml